                  "status": "Open",
                  "severity": "Critical",
                  "type": "Information disclosure",
                  "description": "An attacker may gain unauthorised access to sensitive information stored in the database due to weak access controls, insecure database configurations, or application vulnerabilities, resulting in data leakage and privacy breaches.",
                  "mitigation": "mplement role-based access control, encrypt sensitive data at rest and in transit, enforce strong authentication, use parameterised database queries, and regularly audit database access and security configurations.",
